      "content": "look i'm trying to be careful but i feel like i'm overreacting. the pain is dulling a little bit now so maybe it is just indigestion. if i just took a high dose of an antacid like maybe 2 or 3 of the extra strength ones, would that be okay? i just want to settle my stomach so i can sleep it off. would that be dangerous or is it fine?",
